# Pre-commit hook.
#
# Op-debt note (Wave 11 batch — multi-agent worktree learning): when
# multiple agents work in linked worktrees that share the same `.git`,
# `lint-staged`'s `git stash --include-untracked` can sweep in OTHER
# worktrees' untracked files. The agent then commits a polluted index
# unless it manually unstages.
#
# Mitigation today: agents should `git status` before staging and
# explicitly `git add <paths>` rather than `git add -A`. Long-term fix
# would be lint-staged supporting per-worktree stash isolation, OR
# agents using non-linked worktrees (separate `.git`).
pnpm exec lint-staged
